config POSIX_USER_GROUPS
	bool "POSIX user and group identity"
	help
	  Select 'y' here and Zephyr will provide implementations of the
	  POSIX_USER_GROUPS Option Group: getegid(), geteuid(), getgid(),
	  getgroups(), getlogin(), getuid(), and the corresponding setters,
	  modeling a single-user system whose only identity is the
	  privileged user (uid 0, gid 0).
